    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EPIC ZOMBIES - This Game is in Early Access, The Story and Structure are still in Development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last remaining Human on Earth. Can You Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a unique RPG Survival game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It features all the necessary content needed to provide the Player with the best user and gameplay experience, such as a unique 3D environment, GUI design, and complete survival gameplay mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Game is packed with a complete inventory management and crafting system, building system, environmental harvesting, and looting system, A.I., combat mechanics, and many more features provided down below . . . <br><br>Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Inventory and Crafting System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Quickslots </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Extension / Backpack System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Durability with Repair Functionality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast building and crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building health destruction system alongside repair ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Saving System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot spawning system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Stats (Health, Hunger, and Thirst)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment Harvesting System with respawning (mining, wood cutting, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day &amp; Night + Weather System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holdable Items  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Large Map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Zombies roaming around </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals to Hunt</p>",
